7. Can this code be used for any value of N, or is it limited to 4?
Answer:
This code can be used for any value of N, not just 4. The variable N is global, so you can modify it to change the size of the board and the number of queens to place. For example, changing N = 8 would solve the 8-Queens problem on an 8x8 board. However, for very large values of N, the algorithm may take longer to run due to its exponential time complexity.
